#: package/contents/ui/config/configAutomation.qml:122
msgid ""
"Listens with the microphone every few minutes while music is playing and "
"quietly re-tunes the sync when the speakers have drifted apart. The check "
"rides on a tone too high to hear — the music keeps playing and nothing "
"audible happens. It runs only while a Bluetooth speaker is in the group, "
"never during a recording or an alarm, and audio never leaves this computer."
msgstr ""

